# Game Options with every option turned off. Fixture: France 1599 (colony_fence_to_jobs input.sav as is): head.game_options
# show_indian_moves, show_foreign_moves, fast_piece_slide, end_of_turn, autosave, combat_analysis all True (rows checked),
# tutorial_hints False and water_color_cycling_off True (DOS 0x5383 bit 0: set = cycling off), so those two rows start unchecked.
# Dialog rows (logical y, row centres, FUN_6f74_14c6 / 1b7c): Show Indian Moves 66, Show Foreign Moves 78,
# Fast Piece Slide 90, End of Turn 102, Autosave 114, Combat Analysis 126, Water Color Cycling 138, Tutorial Hints 150. Enter/click outside commits, Esc/right click cancel.
click 22 3                 # GAME menu
click 38 13                # Game Options: "Set Game Options" checklist
click 100 66               # Show Indian Moves off
click 100 78               # Show Foreign Moves off
click 100 90               # Fast Piece Slide off
click 100 102              # End of Turn off
click 100 114              # Autosave off
key Down                   # keyboard: selection moves from Autosave to Combat Analysis
key space                  # Combat Analysis off
key Down                   # selection to Water Color Cycling (already off)
key space                  # on ...
key space                  # ... and off again
key Down                   # selection to Tutorial Hints (already off)
key space                  # on ...
key space                  # ... and off again
key Return                 # all eight rows unchecked; Enter commits and closes the dialog
click 22 3                 # GAME menu again
click 38 13                # Game Options again: all eight rows still unchecked (choices persisted)
click 290 120              # click outside the dialog: commits (no change) and closes
wait 20
